            "review_title": "Review at Barrigón",
            "review_text": "Jun Ann P\n1 contribution\n0\nDisgusting food,poor customer service and expensive\nAug 2025 • Couples\nDisgusting the food made me vomit! \n\nThe salad was old and disgusting the rice dish stunk of old prawns ( contamination when cooking obviously)and the Meat dish BÒ ÁP CHAO NAM TRUFELI served cold ? Made me feel unwell and my partner had to throw up after only a few bites. \n\nIn addition to this the prices were the most expensive of any decent restaurant we had been to and too top it off there was a surprise 5% service charge plus 8 % drinks charge plus 10 % charge on top of the already extremely high prices . Most places already include this in the menu price . The waitress confirmed 3 times there was a 5% additional charge only . \n\nWe requested the 10% and 8% be deducted from the bill and said while we had not eaten most of the terrible meal we would still pay for it to keep the peace however the management didn’t care nor did they care that the waitress had not told us about the 8 and 10% additional charges they wanted full payment or they would call the police. \nThey were not at all flexible extremely ruthless and unprofessional. \n\nI mixed the dishes up to ensure they wouldn’t replate it for the next customer. \nAppalling management, service and food. Beware!!!🤮\nRead more\nInsider tip:\nYou should check the small details written below the menu.\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten September 8, 2025",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
